cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LUMIE in your research, development, or educational work, please cite this repository."
title: "LUMIE: Layered Understanding & Meaning Inference Engine"
abstract: >
  LUMIE is a meaning-centered inference framework designed to model layered
  conceptual structures, deep semantic relationships, and transparent reasoning
  processes. It provides a modular architecture with Streamlit, FastAPI,
  Celery, Redis, and Elasticsearch, enabling scalable semantic computation and
  interpretable inference pipelines for educational and research applications.

